#: AboutDialog.cpp:42
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Office Viewer - Alpha for Maemo 5 is based on KOffice.<br>KOffice is an "
#| "active open source project of many more office applications.<br>Office "
#| "Viewer supports ODF (odt, odp & ods) and Microsoft formats (Word and "
#| "<br>PowerPoint and Excel).<br>Support for Microsoft formats is currently "
#| "not feature complete.<br>Office Viewer is packaged by Maemo, in "
#| "collaboration with members of<br>the KOffice community."
msgid ""
"Office - Alpha for Maemo 5 is based on KOffice.<br>KOffice is an active open "
"source project of many more office applications.<br>Office supports ODF "
"(odt, odp & ods) and Microsoft formats (Word and <br>PowerPoint and Excel)."
"<br>Support for Microsoft formats is currently not feature complete."
"<br>Office is packaged by Maemo, in collaboration with members of<br>the "
"KOffice community."
msgstr ""
"Dokmentenkieker - De Vörverschoon för Maemo 5 buut op KOffice-"
"Apenbornprojekt op.<br>KOffice is en aktiev Apenbornprojekt un bargt en Barg "
"vun Programmen.<br>De Dokmentenkieker ünnerstütt ODF (odt, odp un ods) un "
"Microsoft-Formaten (Word,<br> Powerpoint un Excel).<br>Ünnerstütten vun "
"Microsoft-Formaten is noch nich heel afslaten.<br>Packt wöör de "
"Dokmentenkieker vun Maemo, tosamen mit en poor KOffice-Maten."

